1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,440
[TA Sarah Jenkins] Slide 36 diagrams our full Defense-in-Depth architecture!

2
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:11,700
[Prof. Peter Kim] Never rely on a single lock on your door. We build three concentric rings of security.

3
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:22,180
[TA Sarah Jenkins] Layer 1 is Input Sanitization. Every external document or webhook payload is scrubbed and validated against strict JSON schemas before touching our model.

4
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:36,160
[Prof. Peter Kim] Layer 2 is Runtime Sandboxing. When the agent runs Python scripts or bash commands, it executes inside an isolated, temporary Docker container with zero access to your root host machine!

5
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:48,370
[TA Sarah Jenkins] And Layer 3 is Egress Filtering. The container cannot talk to arbitrary internet servers; outbound traffic is strictly locked to whitelisted Google and enterprise API domains.

6
00:00:48,770 --> 00:00:55,710
[Prof. Peter Kim] Even if an attacker somehow bypasses Layer 1, Layers 2 and 3 trap the attack harmlessly.

